    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, so this is a huge threat to the United States because our currency is reserve currency allows us to do a couple of things. One, it allows us to print dollars and sell our debt. And if we can't sell our debt to overseas countries because they've converted to a different currency for world trade, then we can't deficit spend, which means a massive cut in spending across the board. So, Very clearly the BRICS countries coming together with an announcement, I guess it's in August, August the 26th of the announcement of a potential BRICS sort of digital currency that would be backed by gold. That is undermining the economic power of the United States and the ability of our government to compete with our near peers China and of course, Russia more strategic because of its nuclear arsenal. But clearly, China is competing across the globe to change the rules of the international-based world order. So we can't lose the dollar as the reserve currency. The more countries that join into this BRICS coalition, the more damning it is to the dollar and thus the stability of the United States.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
